trace.request:
Please perform and report:  
1. A full cardiac auscultation — specifically noting presence, timing, character, and maneuvers (e.g., Valsalva, squat-to-stand) that affect any murmur;  
2. Assessment for stigmata of connective tissue disease (e.g., arm span > height, pectus excavatum, lens subluxation, scoliosis);  
3. Neurologic screening exam — including mental status, cranial nerves, motor strength, coordination, and gait.

